{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>And YHWH would speak to Moses face to face.</b> In the adjacent section I will explain it." "<b>And his minister Joshua son of Nun, a young man.</b> He lived one hundred and ten years, and the Sages said that he conquered for seven years, and divided [the land] for seven years; if so he was fifty-six years old — and how does Scripture call him a young man? Thus its grammatical analysis: ומשרתו יהושע בן נון — the service of Joshua son of Nun [was] the service of a young man."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 33, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:40:02.209684493Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}